### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts


### Get single contact (replace with real ID from your database)
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/YOUR_CONTACT_ID_HERE


### Create new contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Blue",
  "birthday": "1990-01-15"
}


### Update contact (replace with real ID)
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/YOUR_CONTACT_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "john.smith@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Green",
  "birthday": "1990-01-15"
}


### Delete contact (replace with real ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/YOUR_CONTACT_ID_HERE


### Test on Render (replace with your Render URL)
GET https://your-app-name.onrender.com/contacts


### Create contact on Render
POST https://your-app-name.onrender.com/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Red",
  "birthday": "1995-05-20"
}